        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Part time employees, after two (2) years of service shall be paid for unused sick days at the end of each sick leave year, on the basis of four (4) hours straight time pay for each unused day. Such payment shall be made on a pro rata basis the first time that a part time employee becomes eligible.",
            "block_bbox": [
                28,
